  "translation": "Nde gorko on ummii fii yahde — kanko e piilagreso mun e suka mun — sangto mun, baaba suka debbo on, wi'i mo: “Ɗoo, tawo, naange on wawii famɗude faade kikiiɗe; hoɗo jemma on, ɗoo tawo; ɗoo, naange na ɗon doga; hoɗo ɗoo, fii ɓernde maa wella, ko on subtaɗo puccol laawol mon on, a yaha to teddeere maa.”",
